title: "02 - Activity Diagram Login"
---
flowchart TD
    classDef admin fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#3b82f6
    classDef system fill:#d1fae5,stroke:#10b981
    classDef action fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#f59e0b

    Start([Mulai]):::admin

    Start --> A1[A1: Pengguna membuka&lt;br/&gt;halaman login]:::admin
    A1 --> S1[S1: Sistem tampilkan&lt;br/&gt;formulir login]:::system
    S1 --> A2[A2: Pengguna mengisi&lt;br/&gt;email dan password]:::admin
    A2 --> S2[S2: Sistem validasi&lt;br/&gt;kelengkapan formulir]:::system
    S2 -->|Tidak Lengkap| S3[S3: Tampil pesan&lt;br/&gt;validasi error]:::system
    S3 --> A2
    S2 -->|Lengkap| S4[S4: Sistem verifikasi&lt;br/&gt;kredensial ke DB]:::system
    S4 -->|Tidak Valid| S5[S5: Tampil pesan&lt;br/&gt;login gagal]:::system
    S5 --> A2
    S4 -->|Valid| S6[S6: Sistem buat session&lt;br/&gt;pengguna]:::system
    S6 --> S7{S7: Cek role&lt;br/&gt;pengguna}:::action
    S7 -->|Admin| S8[S8: Redirect ke&lt;br/&gt;Dashboard Admin]:::system
    S7 -->|Staff| S9[S9: Redirect ke&lt;br/&gt;Dashboard Staff]:::system
    S8 --> Selesai
    S9 --> Selesai([Selesai]):::admin
